			"notes": "## Create: Aeronautics Flashback v1.0.2\n\nFixes contraptions that are entity-ised (turned into a contraption) DURING a replay inside a Sable SubLevel not being rendered.\n\n### Changes\n- Record SubLevel contraption spawns mid-recording by wrapping `ClientboundAddEntityPacket` (together with its `AdvancedAddEntityPayload` structure) into a plot-coordinate custom payload, so it survives Flashback replay playback instead of being consumed by the fake replay server ~20M blocks away.\n- Removed verbose debug logging (now only enabled with `-Daeronautics_flashback.debug=true`).\n\n### Compatibility\n- Minecraft 1.21.1 (NeoForge)\n- Requires: Create, Sable (aeronautics/physics), Flashback"
		},
