			"notes": "# Create: Aeronautics Flashback v1.0.1\n\n## Fixed\n- Fixed an issue where block destruction particles were not playing on sublevels (Sable plot).\n  - Re-implemented Vanilla's destruction effects for sublevels (the previous `globalLevelEvent` was targetting the main `ClientLevel` and was thus ineffective).\n- Added a mechanism to record and replay various level events on sublevels (explosions, potion splashes, fireworks, jukebox record playback, etc.)."
